{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/604234-\u200banne-rice\u2019s-vampire-chronicles-as-requiem-game","id":604234,"title":"\u200bAnne Rice\u2019s Vampire Chronicles as Requiem game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-26T15:32:26-07:00","id":604234,"title":"\u200bAnne Rice\u2019s Vampire Chronicles as Requiem game","content":"As I watched today a fourth ( or maybe fifth? ) time in my life <i>Interview with Vampire</i> movie in preparation for mine New Orleans <b>Beast</b> game with <b>Vampire</b> overtones I could not resist. I thought for years forum needs it topic about Anne Rice\u2019s <i>Vampire Chronicles</i> as inspiration for the <b>Requiem</b> game. Of course this topic is full of spoilers so you read it on your own responsibility.<br /> <br /> So let\u2019s start with <i>Interview</i> stuff then\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Lestat de Lioncourt</b> \u2013 XVIII century French nobleman Daeva with philosophical outlook of Lancea et Santcum. He finally left Second Estate when he journeyed to New World. Lestat views him as predator on sinners that can be hedonist by this. He believes God has cursed him so he could be Devil in his unlife. Later, he becomes more and more secular in his views, but still respect the Almighty. He even starts an goth band in 1980s.<br /> <br /> <b>Louis de Pointe du Lac</b> \u2013 New Orleans Creole plantation owner from the end of XVIII century, Embraced by Lestat as Daeva. After century of struggle with his unlife, he despise his Sire and vampire society at large ( see Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Vampires ). Now on self-imposed exile from the Kindred world.<br /> <br /> <b>Armand</b> \u2013 A XV century devoted religious artist from Kiev Rus that become Daeva 17 year old vampire in Venice. Shortly after, he was brainwashed and become leader of Belial\u2019s Brood on the Paris cemetery. When Lestat is disproving his whole beliefs, he destroy his Brood and join him in Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Vampires, becoming leader of group when de Lioncourt leaves it for America.<br /> <br /> <b>Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des Vampires</b> \u2013 Small community ( Coterie or Covenant? ) of several vampires artists made by the Lestat in his early nights in Paris. Group is known from making inhuman shows as part of their act, playing on the assumptions of viewers they see human actors playing as vampires. Destroyed by Louis at the end XIX century in revenge on group for putting Final Death on his and Lestat\u2019s \u201cdaughter\u201d Claudia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T12:08:52-07:00","id":608285,"title":"","content":"More Character's More Vampires","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Don't shoot that man he's an unpaid intern.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7070-sakkhet","name":"Sakkhet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-30T15:14:30-07:00","id":608489,"title":"","content":"Maybe show your take? I do not know other books than <i>Interview with a Vampire</i>, <i>Vampire Lestat</i> and some parts of<i> Gold and Blood</i>. If you describe character in broad stroakes I can advice Clan and Covenant ( if any ).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T14:48:25-07:00","id":623667,"title":"","content":"I have read all of the vampire chronicles except the new one Prince Lestat. Here's my take...<br /> <br /> Louis: Daeva and Unaligned <br /> <br /> Lestat: Daeva and Lancea Sanctum <br /> <br /> Claudia: Daeva and Unaligned <br /> <br /> Antoine: The piano boy who Lestat turned in the late 1800's (Interview with the Vampire). Daeva and Unaligned<br /> <br /> Madeleine: Claudia's adopted mother (Interview with the Vampire). Daeva and Unaligned<br /> <br /> Armand: He sounds like a Daeva but he was turned by Marius. Ventrue and Lancea Sanctum (formally Belial's Brood) <br /> <br /> Gabrielle de Lioncourt: She sounds like a Gangrel but was turned by Lestat (The Vampire Lestat). Daeva and Unaligned<br /> <br /> Nicholas &quot;Nicki&quot;: Daeva and Unaligned (The Vampire Lestat)<br /> <br /> Marius: Ventrue (or Julii) and Invictus<br /> <br /> Magnus: Lestat's maker (The Vampire Lestat). Daeva and Unaligned or Ordo Dracul <br /> <br /> Merrick Mayfair: Formally a witch from the Mayfair Witches (Merrick novel). Maybe a Proximi or Moros (she was a necromancer voodoo witch). She sounds like a Mekhet but was turned by Louis. Daeva and Circle of the Crone<br /> <br /> David Talbot: Formally superior general of the Talamasca. Maybe a physic, sleepwalker/proximi, or Mastigos. He sounds like a Mekhet but was turned by Lestat. Daeva and Ordo Dracul<br /> <br /> Mona Mayfair: Formally a witch from the Mayfair Witches' family (Mayfair Witches Chronicles and Blood Canticle). A proximi turned into a vampire. Daeva and Invictus or Unaligned <br /> <br /> Pandora: She sounds like a Daeva but was turned by Marius (Pandora novel). Ventrue (or Julii) and Circle of the Crone<br /> <br /> Bianca Solderini: (The Vampire Armand) Ventrue and Invictus or Unaligned<br /> <br /> Daniel Molloy: The young reporter who interviewed Louis (Interview with the Vampire). Ventrue and Unaligned <br /> <br /> Benjamin &quot;Benji&quot; Mahmoud: (The Vampire Armand) Ventrue and Carthian Movement <br /> <br /> Sybelle: (The Vampire Armand) Ventrue and Carthian Movement<br /> <br /> Jesse Reeves: (The Queen of the Damned) Mekhet and Ordo Dracul<br /> <br /> Vittorio di Ranairi: (Vittirio, the Vampire) Ventrue and Lancea Sanctum <br /> <br /> Well that's the most I can identify. The rest are Ancient and not much is mention about them or I'm not sure which clan they would belong to. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T18:42:49-07:00","id":623843,"title":"","content":"Lots of Ventrue - especially Marius and Malloy are interesting me here...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-11T21:45:52-07:00","id":623919,"title":"","content":"Marius to me always seem like a lord than a siren. Sure he may be artistic but his personality and character seems to fit well as a Ventrue. Molloy was turned by Armand, which Marius turned Armand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2360-cecoyotl","name":"Cecoyotl","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2360_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"207"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}